1
00:00:00,092 --> 00:00:04,592
(Leonard:)...most people don't sort their breakfast
cereal numerically by fiber content.

2
00:00:05,139 --> 00:00:08,349
(Sheldon:)Excuse me, but I think
we've both found that helpful at times.

3
00:00:11,228 --> 00:00:13,818
- Come on, we should go.
- Hang on.

4
00:00:14,731 --> 00:00:17,651
- What are you doing?
- I'm straightening up.

5
00:00:17,818 --> 00:00:19,698
(Leonard:)Sheldon, this is not your home.

6
00:00:19,862 --> 00:00:23,452
(Sheldon:)This is not anyone's home.
This is a swirling vortex of entropy.

7
00:00:25,367 --> 00:00:28,707
(Leonard:)When the transvestite lived here,
you didn't care how he kept the place.

8
00:00:28,871 --> 00:00:30,081
(Sheldon:)Because it was immaculate.

9
00:00:30,247 --> 00:00:32,247
(Sheldon:)I mean, you open that man's closet...

10
00:00:32,416 --> 00:00:37,716
(Sheldon:)...it was left to right, evening gowns,
cocktail dresses and his police uniforms.

11
00:00:38,297 --> 00:00:42,087
- What were you doing in his closet?
- I helped him run some cable for a webcam.

12
00:00:42,259 --> 00:00:44,049
- Hey, guys.
- Oh, hey, Penny.

13
00:00:44,219 --> 00:00:46,349
(Leonard:)This just arrived.
Brought this up. Just now.

14
00:00:46,513 --> 00:00:48,723
Great. Was it hard getting up the stairs?

15
00:00:48,891 --> 00:00:50,061
(Leonard:)- No.
- No?

16
00:00:50,225 --> 00:00:53,895
(Leonard:)- No.
- No.

17
00:00:54,062 --> 00:00:56,062
(Leonard:)- We'll get out of your hair.
- Okay, great.

18
00:00:56,231 --> 00:01:00,021
(Penny:)Thank you again.

